of any of the Persons set forth in <U>Schedule 1.1</U> of the Seller Disclosure Schedules after reasonable inquiry of direct reports,
and does not include knowledge or awareness of any other individual or any constructive, implied or imputed knowledge or awareness.</FONT></P>

