<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">No
stockholder of the Corporation shall ever be held liable or responsible for the contracts or faults of the Corporation in any further
sum than the unpaid balance of the shares for which such stockholder has subscribed, nor shall any mere informality in organization have
